Use reference-taking absl mutex locks in ipcz.
Origin: EmberBSD contributors (AI-assisted). The shared Abseil deprecates the
MutexLock/ReaderMutexLock/WriterMutexLock pointer constructors and
Mutex::Lock/Unlock; ipcz builds with -Werror. Pass the mutex by reference and
call lock()/unlock(), the replacements Abseil names, across all of ipcz.

